<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">N-No way...</font>

168
00:16:48,240 --> 00:16:52,940
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">First, I need to see you
off to the next world...</font>

169
00:16:56,820 --> 00:17:00,820
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It looks like you've accepted your fate...</font>

170
00:17:11,060 --> 00:17:12,680
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Son-<i>kun</i>!</font>

171
00:17:15,890 --> 00:17:18,060
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Son-<i>kun</i>! He's with the Red Ribbon Army!</font>

172
00:17:18,060 --> 00:17:22,070
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He was about to kill us! Beat him up!</font>

173
00:17:22,070 --> 00:17:23,870
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Red Ribbon, huh?!</font>

174
00:17:23,870 --> 00:17:28,340
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So you're finally here.
Congratulations on finding us.</font>

175
00:17:28,340 --> 00:17:30,540
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Are you the one who beat up Kuririn?!</font>

176
00:17:30,540 --> 00:17:32,740
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Kuririn? Oh, you mean him...</font>

177
00:17:32,750 --> 00:17:36,280
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's right. I was just
about to finish him off, too.</font>

178
00:17:36,280 --> 00:17:38,880
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">G-Goku...</font>

179
00:17:38,880 --> 00:17:42,720
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I won't let you do that!
You'll fight <i>me</i> now!</font>

180
00:17:44,660 --> 00:17:46,490
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">As you wish!</font>

181
00:18:03,640 --> 00:18:05,800
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You're nothing special!</font>

182
00:18:05,810 --> 00:18:08,070
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">A-Amazing!</font>

183
00:18:08,070 --> 00:18:13,410
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Goku's grown even stronger than he
was at the Tenkaichi Budokai...!</font>

184
00:18:13,410 --> 00:18:18,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Aw man, I thought you
were stronger than that!</font>

185
00:18:18,550 --> 00:18:20,380
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You'll pay!</font>

186
00:18:23,190 --> 00:18:25,290
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You'll pay for that!</font>

187
00:18:26,320 --> 00:18:29,410
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I will <i>make</i> you pay!</font>

188
00:19:21,470 --> 00:19:25,770
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Son-<i>kun</i>! Don't look at his eyes! Don't look!</font>

189
00:19:36,300 --> 00:19:38,270
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">W-What's going on...?!</font>

190
00:19:38,270 --> 00:19:41,490
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I... can't move...</font>

191
00:19:41,490 --> 00:19:43,320
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Too late...!</font>

192
00:19:52,430 --> 00:19:54,590
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What do you think...</font>

193
00:19:57,170 --> 00:19:59,740
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">...of my psychic ability?</font>

194
00:19:59,740 --> 00:20:02,510
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Damn, what is this...?!</font>

195
00:20:02,510 --> 00:20:05,840
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You really socked it to me just now...!</font>

196
00:20:10,800 --> 00:20:14,060
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Thanks for earlier!</font>

197
00:20:18,400 --> 00:20:21,370
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What happened to all that
liveliness you just had?</font>

198
00:20:21,370 --> 00:20:24,180
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'll cheer you back up...</font>

199
00:20:24,180 --> 00:20:26,580
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Son-<i>kun</i>...</font>

200
00:20:29,980 --> 00:20:31,850
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Here we go...</font>

201
00:20:36,880 --> 00:20:38,650
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It's really starting to come down now!</font>

202
00:20:38,650 --> 00:20:40,680
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Unfortunately, it looks like
I need to get out of here</font>

203
00:20:40,680 --> 00:20:43,950
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">with the Dragon Ball and the
treasure as quickly as possible...</font>

204
00:20:53,870 --> 00:20:58,250
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You! Girl! You know where
the Dragon Ball is, don't you?!</font>

205
00:20:58,250 --> 00:21:01,890
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Tell me where, or I shoot the kid!</font>

206
00:21:01,890 --> 00:21:03,040
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Well?!</font>

207
00:21:03,040 --> 00:21:05,170
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh, r-right...</font>

208
00:21:05,170 --> 00:21:07,340
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Judging from the location on the radar...</font>

209
00:21:07,340 --> 00:21:11,950
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It's probably at the bottom of that pool!</font>

210
00:21:11,950 --> 00:21:13,880
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">D-Damn it...!</font>

211
00:21:15,920 --> 00:21:20,790
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Thank you! I no longer have
any use for the lot of you!</font>

212
00:21:22,060 --> 00:21:23,620
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh, what a pity!</font>

213
00:21:23,630 --> 00:21:28,100
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Everyone who defies the Red
Ribbon Army must be put to death!</font>

214
00:21:28,100 --> 00:21:33,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">W-What?! But didn't I just tell
you where the Dragon Ball is?!</font>

215
00:21:33,200 --> 00:21:34,940
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's not fair!</font>

216
00:21:34,940 --> 00:21:39,110
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Not fair? What a beautiful phrase!</font>

217
00:21:39,110 --> 00:21:42,410
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Well, time to die!</font>

218
00:21:44,410 --> 00:21:49,120
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Not even Son-<i>kun</i> could
survive a shot from that gun!</font>

219
00:21:49,120 --> 00:21:52,090
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">A-And then I'll be the next one to die...!</font>

220
00:21:52,090 --> 00:21:53,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Even though I'm so cute!</font>

221
00:21:53,560 --> 00:21:56,590
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Even though I'm so <i>Pichi-pichi</i>!</font>

222
00:21:56,590 --> 00:21:59,130
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You sure can talk a
lot at a time like this.</font>

223
00:21:59,130 --> 00:22:02,560
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">D-Dammit...!</font>

224
00:22:02,560 --> 00:22:04,230
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Farewell!</font>

225
00:22:07,120 --> 00:22:08,790
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Eek! A mouse! A mouse!</font>

226
00:22:08,790 --> 00:22:10,760
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Unclean! Unclean!</font>

227
00:22:14,100 --> 00:22:16,070
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh! I can move!</font>

228
00:22:16,070 --> 00:22:20,070
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Look! His psychic powers
wore off thanks to the mouse!</font>

229
00:22:20,070 --> 00:22:22,910
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Now! Get 'im!</font>

230
00:22:22,910 --> 00:22:26,080
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You're in for it now!</font>

231
00:22:26,080 --> 00:22:31,080
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh, no! My psychic ability...!</font>

232
00:22:31,080 --> 00:22:33,750
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Your penalty is my
paper-scissor-rock attack!</font>

233
00:22:33,750 --> 00:22:37,190
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">W-What?! Alright, I'll do it again!</font>

234
00:22:41,930 --> 00:22:45,700
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh, no you don't!</font>

235
00:22:45,700 --> 00:22:48,930
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">My eyes! My eyes...!</font>

236
00:22:48,930 --> 00:22:52,100
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Paper-scissors-rock!</font>

237
00:22:59,380 --> 00:23:00,980
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You did it!</font>

238
00:23:00,980 --> 00:23:03,970
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">--Hurray!
--Peace! Peace!</font>

239
00:23:12,360 --> 00:23:14,770
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">W-We need to get out of here fast!</font>

240
00:23:14,770 --> 00:23:16,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Bulma! Where's the Dragon Ball?</font>

241
00:23:16,200 --> 00:23:19,600
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The bottom of that pool,
but forget about it!</font>

242
00:23:19,610 --> 00:23:22,110
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">There's no time!</font>

243
00:23:22,110 --> 00:23:24,280
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You two go on ahead!</font>

244
00:23:24,280 --> 00:23:27,810
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'll escape right after
I find the Dragon Ball!</font>

245
00:23:27,810 --> 00:23:29,150
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Okay...!</font>

246
00:23:29,150 --> 00:23:30,980
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's crazy!</font>

247
00:23:32,450 --> 00:23:33,990
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That jerk!</font>

248
00:23:33,990 --> 00:23:37,220
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Nothing we can do now!
Let's go on ahead and wait for him!</font>

249
00:24:27,380 --> 00:24:30,150
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">If it's like this here, then the path
back to our mini-sub must already be...</font>

250
00:24:30,150 --> 00:24:33,390
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">...blocked off! But still...</font>

251
00:24:33,390 --> 00:24:36,080
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">--...all we can do now is run!
--Yeah!</font>

252
00:25:22,900 --> 00:25:24,300
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It's really falling apart now!</font>

253
00:25:24,300 --> 00:25:26,500
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Let's see...</font>

254
00:25:28,440 --> 00:25:31,340
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Where are you?!</font>

255
00:25:41,060 --> 00:25:43,120
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hurry!</font>

256
00:25:46,540 --> 00:25:49,540
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Great! The path's still open!</font>

257
00:25:49,540 --> 00:25:51,640
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yay!</font>

258
00:25:57,020 --> 00:25:59,290
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">--A-Are we still alive...?
--Yeah, somehow...</font>

259
00:25:59,290 --> 00:26:01,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But the exit's closed off now...</font>

260
00:26:01,560 --> 00:26:04,460
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">We have to find some other way out!</font>

261
00:26:09,010 --> 00:26:14,400
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's it! As it's already a sink-or-swim
situation, let's try that mini-sub!</font>

262
00:26:14,400 --> 00:26:17,400
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">If we're lucky, we might
be able to get outside!</font>

263
00:26:27,230 --> 00:26:28,230
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">There you are!</font>

264
00:26:28,230 --> 00:26:31,230
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Got ya!</font>

265
00:26:31,230 --> 00:26:33,060
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Ow...!</font>

266
00:26:33,070 --> 00:26:37,070
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I owe you my life, so I'll help you out!</font>

267
00:26:37,070 --> 00:26:38,730
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Get inside my mouth!</font>

268
00:27:24,440 --> 00:27:27,040
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So beautiful...!</font>

269
00:27:27,040 --> 00:27:31,950
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">All of this treasure is mine!
Mine and mine alone!</font>

270
00:27:31,950 --> 00:27:34,880
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The jewels, the gold, the coins!</font>

271
00:27:44,590 --> 00:27:47,290
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The engine started! We can leave!</font>

272
00:27:47,300 --> 00:27:49,060
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Goku! Where are you?!</font>

273
00:27:49,060 --> 00:27:50,690
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hurry up!</font>

274
00:27:58,310 --> 00:28:00,240
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Goku!</font>

275
00:28:06,110 --> 00:28:09,480
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No good! We can't wait any longer!</font>

276
00:28:09,480 --> 00:28:12,350
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">We're diving! Hurry and close the hatch!</font>

277
00:28:12,350 --> 00:28:15,190
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Are you just gonna leave Goku here to die?!</font>

278
00:28:15,190 --> 00:28:16,520
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What're you talking about?!</font>

279
00:28:16,520 --> 00:28:21,030
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">To be blunt, the most important thing
in this world to me is my own life!</font>

280
00:28:21,030 --> 00:28:22,860
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What about you?!</font>

281
00:28:24,670 --> 00:28:27,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">S-Same here, but...</font>

282
00:28:30,200 --> 00:28:34,270
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Don't worry, he won't
kick the bucket so easily!</font>

283
00:28:36,340 --> 00:28:39,210
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Kuririn! Here we go!</font>

284
00:28:39,210 --> 00:28:43,480
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">If we can't get out into the ocean
by diving down here, then it's all over!</font>

285
00:28:57,670 --> 00:29:03,440
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>The pirate cave is really falling apart now.</i></font>

286
00:29:03,450 --> 00:29:06,850
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>What will happen to Bulma? Kuririn?</i></font>

287
00:29:06,850 --> 00:29:09,340
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>And what about Goku?</i></font>

288
00:29:13,360 --> 00:29:18,090
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Will they be able to safely escape?!</i></font>

289
00:29:44,350 --> 00:29:47,220
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Oide fantaji</i></font>

290
00:29:44,350 --> 00:29:47,220
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Come along, fantasy</i></font>

291
00:29:47,220 --> 00:29:49,860
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Suki sa misuteri</i></font>

292
00:29:47,220 --> 00:29:49,860
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>I enjoy a mystery</i></font>

293
00:29:49,860 --> 00:29:56,400
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Kimi no wakasa kakusanai de</i></font>

294
00:29:49,860 --> 00:29:56,400
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Don't you go hiding your youth!</i></font>

295
00:29:56,400 --> 00:29:59,400
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Fushigi shitakute</i></font>

296
00:29:56,400 --> 00:29:59,400
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Wanting to perform the mysterious</i></font>

297
00:29:59,400 --> 00:30:01,900
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Boken shitakute</i></font>

298
00:29:59,400 --> 00:30:01,900
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Wanting to pursue the adventure</i></font>

299
00:30:01,900 --> 00:30:07,910
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Dare mo min'na uzu-uzu shite 'ru</i></font>

300
00:30:01,900 --> 00:30:07,910
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Everyone is itching to go!</i></font>

301
00:30:07,910 --> 00:30:13,950
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Otona no furi shite akiramecha</i></font>

302
00:30:07,910 --> 00:30:13,950
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>If you act like an adult and give up</i></font>

303
00:30:13,950 --> 00:30:20,090
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Kiseki no nazo nado tokenai yo</i></font>

304
00:30:13,950 --> 00:30:20,090
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>You'll never unravel the mystery of the miracle!</i></font>

305
00:30:20,090 --> 00:30:31,230
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Motto wairudo ni motto takumashiku ikite goran</i></font>

306
00:30:20,090 --> 00:30:31,230
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Go on and try to live</i>
<i>even more wild and strong!</i></font>

307
00:30:31,230 --> 00:30:38,770
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Romantikku ageru yo, romantikku ageru yo</i></font>

308
00:30:31,230 --> 00:30:38,770
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>I'll give you a romance,</i>
<i>I'll give you a romance</i></font>

309
00:30:38,770 --> 00:30:43,280
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Honto no yuki misete kuretara</i></font>

310
00:30:38,770 --> 00:30:43,280
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>If you will show me your true courage</i></font>

311
00:30:43,280 --> 00:30:50,680
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Romantikku ageru yo, romantikku ageru yo</i></font>

312
00:30:43,280 --> 00:30:50,680
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>I'll give you a romance,</i>
<i>I'll give you a romance</i></font>

313
00:30:50,690 --> 00:30:59,290
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Tokimeku mune ni</i>
<i>kira-kira hikatta yume o ageru yo</i></font>

314
00:30:50,690 --> 00:30:59,290
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>I'll give your pounding heart</i>
<i>a glittery, shining dream!</i></font>

